    {
      "Original": "Disables global gathering of runtimes and found hoards.\r\nPurely used to build a accurate global statistic.\r\nOnly sends time of a run, if a hoard is found and the travel time to hoard.\r\nCharacter, timestamp or any other identifying info will NEVER send!",
      "Container": "HoardFarm.Data.Strings.resources",
      "Key": "ConfigWindow_DisableStatisticGathering_Help",
      "Translated": "停用全局探索用时及秘宝发现情况的统计。\r\n这些数据仅用于计算总体统计。\r\n发送内容仅包括每次探索的用时、是否找到秘宝及前往秘宝的用时。\r\n不会发送角色信息、时间戳或其他身份信息。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
